WEBVTT

00:00:06.488 --> 00:00:10.920
Arrange start page: turn blocks on or off and change the order.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.532
Now Recovery is near the top.

00:00:13.582 --> 00:00:17.669
Settings → System: time zone, units, weather, language and theme.

00:00:17.719 --> 00:00:23.694
For example, choose the dark theme.

00:00:23.744 --> 00:00:27.998
Customize menu: hide pages you don't use or reorder them.
